{"version":1,"content":"<p>馬來西亞女神黃潔琪（Miko）樣子甜美、性格爽朗，擁有得天獨厚火辣身材的她，被網民封「翻版林明禎」，加上她不時於社交網派福利，深受一眾宅男喜愛，社交網更坐擁過百萬粉絲，認真厲害。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;不過，雖然擁有如此</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:03:48.441903+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T06:34:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T06:57:13.430070+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T06:57:13.430070+00:00","content_hash":"82fb5838a75e2669db1eb975eee84a25fef3df189cdfe5e722d0eb6264d87895","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}